    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/8d2b93499de4b8b0fcd2f2c658abdb42.avif?t=1755524585\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monkey Fruit Fight! brings competitive shooter mechanics to a colorful 2D world. Jump, dodge, aim, and fire in lightning-fast 1v1 battles that feel like arena FPS shooters meets retro arcade gaming! Dominate friends and strangers alike to the beat of a pumping synthwave soundtrack!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/a0d687d9beeaf0e63d049235e4525a5c.poster.avif?t=1755524585\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/a0d687d9beeaf0e63d049235e4525a5c.webm?t=1755524585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/a0d687d9beeaf0e63d049235e4525a5c.mp4?t=1755524585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a1 INSTANT ARCADE COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three clicks and you're dueling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast matches (best of 5 rounds, max 100 seconds)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for quick gaming sessions anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All ages - competitive fun without violence!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf4c CHOOSE YOUR FRUIT LOADOUT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick 3 weapons from your arsenal:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banana, Watermelon, Pineapple, Pumpkin, Coconut, Carambola</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has different firing patterns and damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like choosing your loadout in an FPS - but fruity!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf PRECISION PLATFORMER COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dodge, and navigate colorful arenas with unique features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim with precision - every shot counts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement and positioning matter as much as aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge players on Android devices too - cross-platform duels!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f PURE RETRO ARCADE VIBES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-perfect 80s/90s arcade aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original synthwave soundtrack pumps up the action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 character skins inspired by retro culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful arenas from tropical beaches to space stations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 COMPETITIVE BUT ACCESSIBLE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn - hard to master platformer mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family-friendly combat that's genuinely competitive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick to jump in, endless skill ceiling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends or find opponents worldwide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple server regions for great ping - because ping matters!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle in colorful arenas where every match feels like an intense arcade showdown - but with the strategic depth of modern competitive gaming!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/6b8c9aa7a2dacff92d07452689a95170.poster.avif?t=1755524585\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/6b8c9aa7a2dacff92d07452689a95170.webm?t=1755524585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/6b8c9aa7a2dacff92d07452689a95170.mp4?t=1755524585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/e65313941cf065a425859938089e1196.poster.avif?t=1755524585\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/e65313941cf065a425859938089e1196.webm?t=1755524585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/e65313941cf065a425859938089e1196.mp4?t=1755524585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/8b9bf3b2572c994e659fb2d3192f0e8d.poster.avif?t=1755524585\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/8b9bf3b2572c994e659fb2d3192f0e8d.webm?t=1755524585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/8b9bf3b2572c994e659fb2d3192f0e8d.mp4?t=1755524585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/71996b9e92e5e98bef250797a11fab93.poster.avif?t=1755524585\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/71996b9e92e5e98bef250797a11fab93.webm?t=1755524585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764780/extras/71996b9e92e5e98bef250797a11fab93.mp4?t=1755524585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
